#!/usr/bin/python3 -I
"""Pomona - graphical assistant for the Apple T1 on Linux.

One window, its pages listed in a sidebar:
  Setup      every step of the fix, each marked done or with a button
  Wi-Fi      the Broadcom card: what is missing, fix, undo, certificate
  Audio      the Cirrus Logic sound chip: the Mac driver, fix, undo, certificate
  Report     writes the compatibility certificate
  Touch Bar  after installation: default key set, Fn, dimming, per-application key sets

Everything that needs root goes through pkexec and pomona-admin.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
"""
